/*
# Exercise visuals
Adds a start/end-position image link to matched exercises (free exercise-db library, public domain).
The app flips the two frames (…/0.jpg, …/1.jpg) as a short animation and also offers a video-guide link.
Only fills exercises that have no image yet.
*/
